hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"405","Ahmad ibn Abdah ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne humein khabar di, Abu Harun al-Madani se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Abbas Raziallahu anhu ke ghar mein ek parnala tha jo masjid mein girta tha, phir Hazrat Umar Raziallahu anhu aaye aur use ukhaar diya. Hazrat Abbas Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne use khud apne haath se lagaya tha. Hazrat Umar Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Tumhare liye meri peeth ke siwa koi seedhi nahi hogi yahan tak ke tum use us ki jagah wapas lagao. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Yeh Isa kirana farosh ka bhai hai, Abu Harun, jabke Isa darzi hai, kirana farosh aur kapde kootne wala, aur woh Isa ibn Maysarah hai, aur us ka bhai la-bas hai."
"406","Muhammad ibn Abdullah al-Qattan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman yani Ibn Maghra ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban se, apne chacha Wasi ibn Habban se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Abu Lubabah Raziallahu anhu ka ek khajoor ka khosha ek shakhs ke bagh mein tha, to unhon ne us se baat ki ke tum apne khoshe tak pahunchne ke liye mere bagh mein chalte ho, main tumhein tumhare bagh mein us jaisa deta hun, pas use mujh se nikal lo. Us ne inkar kiya, to unhon ne Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se is ke bare mein baat ki. Aap ne farmaya: Ai Abu Lubabah, apne khoshe jaisa le lo aur use apne maal se mila lo aur apne saathi se woh rok lo jo woh napasand karta hai. Unhon ne kaha: Main aisa karne wala nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Phir jao aur us ke liye us ke khoshe jaisa us ke bagh mein kaat do, phir us ke upar deewar bana do, kyunke Islam mein na nuqsan hai na badle ka nuqsan. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Al-adhq fatha ke saath khajoor ka darakht hai, aur al-idhq kasra ke saath khosha hai."
"407","Uthman ibn Abi Shaybah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah Ibn al-Mubarak se, aur maine use Sa'id ibn Yaqub par Ibn Mubarak se parha, Mamar se, Ayyub se, Abu Qilabah se ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Khudai mein ek dusre ko nuqsan na pahunchayo. Sa'id ne izafa kiya: Aur woh yeh hai ke aadmi dusre aadmi ke pehlu mein is liye khode ke us ka pani le jaye."
